    ('dashboard.emptyText', 'The dashboard while the person has no game account yet: the text under the invitation''s heading. "UID" (a player''s number), "artifacts" and "relics" (what characters wear in the two games) are the games'' words: they stay in English and are not declined. No placeholders.'),
    ('dashboard.importGame', 'The dashboard while the person has no game account yet: a button for each game, opening the import wizard for it. {game}: the game''s name, "Genshin Impact" or "Honkai: Star Rail" - never translated or declined.'),
