    ('account.showcaseOnlyHint', 'The dashboard: the tooltip of the "Showcase only" chip on an account''s card. "Character Showcase" (the in-game menu) and "UID" (a player''s number) are the games'' words and stay as they are. No full stop. No placeholders.'),
