    ('account.runSummary.few', 'The account page, import history: what a run that went through brought in - the form for 2 to 4 characters (in English the same as for many). {count}: the number of characters. {items}: the game''s word for what characters wear, "Artifacts" or "Relics" - never translated or declined; it stands before a colon. {itemCount}: how many of those.'),
    ('account.runSummary.other', 'The account page, import history: what a run that went through brought in - the form for 0 and for 5 or more characters. {count}: the number of characters. {items}: the game''s word for what characters wear, "Artifacts" or "Relics" - never translated or declined; it stands before a colon. {itemCount}: how many of those.'),
    -- signIn (the shell part)
    ('signIn.intro', 'The sign-in page: the text under the app''s name, saying what the app is for and how to get in. "Genshin Impact" and "Honkai: Star Rail" are the games'' names and "anotoki" is the name of the account people sign in with: they stay as they are. No placeholders.'),
    ('signIn.noAccess', 'The sign-in page, for somebody who is signed in but has no role in this app. {name}: the account''s user name or email address (or the words of common.userFallback), drawn in bold - the sentence is cut there, so the name must not need an ending. "Build Analyzer" is the app''s name, never translated or declined.'),
    ('signIn.anotherAccount', 'The sign-in page, for somebody whose account has no access: the button that goes to the sign-in again, to sign in as somebody else. No placeholders.'),
