    ('importWizard.file.infoDetected', 'The import wizard (/import), step Import of a file: the chosen file, when the app recognised which game it is from. {name}: the file''s name. {kilobytes}: its size in kilobytes, a whole number already written the way the language writes numbers. {game}: the game''s name ("Genshin Impact", "Honkai: Star Rail"), never translated - in Slovak after "z hry", not declined.'),
    ('importWizard.file.paste', 'The import wizard (/import), step Import of a file: the title of the panel that opens a text field for pasting the export. It continues the drop area above, so it starts with an ellipsis and a lower-case letter. No tool is ever named. No placeholders.'),
