    ('importGuide.hsr.file.pro3', 'The import wizard (/import), step Method: the card of the Honkai: Star Rail import of a full inventory file, an advantage (a line with a check mark, no full stop). "relic optimizers" are a kind of tool players use; none is ever named. "relics" is the game''s word, never translated or declined - in Slovak it is the object of „optimalizujú“, where it takes no ending. No placeholders.'),
    ('importGuide.hsr.file.con1', 'The import wizard (/import), step Method: the card of the Honkai: Star Rail import of a full inventory file, a limit (a line with a dash, no full stop). No tool is ever named; the operating system is. No placeholders.'),
