    ('importGuide.genshin.showcase.trouble1', 'The import wizard (/import), step Prepare: the guide for the Genshin Impact import by UID (the in-game Character Showcase), a line of "Something not working?". It begins with what the import says when the option is off (the string import.error.showcase_details_off), so the two should read alike. "Show Character Details" and "Edit Profile" are the game''s own menu names: they stay in English, as the game shows them. No placeholders.'),
